            "text": "noncomputable def actualDebt (F : Profile) (C T : ℝ) (li : ℝ → ℝ) (oldf oldU : Field)\n    (eta : ℝ) : Debt :=\n  moments F.U F.E matchFraction eta -\n    moments (baseU F C oldU) (baseE F C T li oldf) matchFraction eta"
